"type": "heading"}, {"content": "Un article partitif est  employ\u00e9 devant les noms exprimant une quantit\u00e9 non-comptable et se place avant le nom.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"masc\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"f\u00e9m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pl.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"devant la voyelle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"du\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"de la\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"des\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"de + l'\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Je mange des chips.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je bois du chocolat chaud.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je d\u00e9guste de la glace.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je bois de l'eau.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\u00c9crivez 5 \u00e0 8 plats sur le menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choisissez un prix pour chacun des plats.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Avec un partenaire, jouez la situation dans un caf\u00e9. Votre partenaire vous pose des questions sur le prix et vous lui r\u00e9pondez.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Changez de r\u00f4le.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris un court menu.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je dis combien co\u00fbtent les choses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je commande des plats dans un caf\u00e9.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : J'ai envie de manger quelque chose de sucr\u00e9. J'adore les biscuits !<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> :  T'aimes vraiment le sucre !"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "5000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : \u00a0Oui j'adore \u00e7a. O\u00f9  peut-on aller ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Euh... Il y a une p\u00e2tisserie en bas de la rue. Ton ami Matt y travaille en tant qu'employ\u00e9."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Est-ce que c'est cher ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Oui, un peu."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "17000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Combien co\u00fbte une part de g\u00e2teau ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Une part de g\u00e2teau co\u00fbte environ 4 euros. Je d\u00e9teste leurs g\u00e2teaux."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "24000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Est-ce qu'ils ont des pains au chocolat ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Oui, ils en ont."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "27800", "id": 6, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Combien co\u00fbtent les pains au chocolat ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Environ 1.50 euros."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img03.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 7, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Ah d'accord... Est-ce qu'ils sont frais ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Ah oui, toujours."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob09re2img03.jpg", "time": "36500", "id": 8, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Humm ! Je veux boire du lait pendant que je mange mon pain au chocolat. <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : D'accord, je prendrai juste un caf\u00e9."}], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Student can identify articles 'a, an, the',", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Qu'est-ce que vous aimez acheter dans un caf\u00e9&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rez-vous les biscuits, les pains au chocolat ou les g\u00e2teaux&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de la nourriture et demander combien \u00e7a co\u00fbte.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de ce que j'aime et de ce que je n'aime pas.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de ce que je poss\u00e8de.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "J'adore les biscuits... et toi ?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Charlotte et Jean parlent de biscuits, pains au chocolat et g\u00e2teaux... <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">hummm !</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "Vous avez deux essais.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Il vo